{"availability":"available","full":"atlassian-labs/roving-office","name":"roving-office","description":"An office full of characters, and the characters are your AI agents. A soft-3D isometric room that renders live agent sessions as people who walk in, sit down, look things up and clock off.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-18T22:04:49Z","updated":"2026-10-04T08:18:10Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://therovingoffice.com","topics":["agent-observability","ai-agents","claude-code","developer-tools","isometric","observability","threejs","visualization"],"demo":"https://therovingoffice.com/office/TEST-0000","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:20.043Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:20.043Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:20.043Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:18:20.043Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An office full of characters, and the characters are your AI agents.","It is a soft-3D isometric office where your agents come to life — stylised characters that walk in through the door, sit down at workstations, look things up, take coffee breaks, and drop finished work in the mailbox before clocking off. One character per agent session. The room is the status board.","The goal is skeuomorphic and fun rather than a true simulation: the elements are chosen because they tangentially relate to the work being done, and because an office with nothing to notice is a screensaver. It's very alpha, and was written mostly on a plane."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/atlassian-labs/roving-office/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d6ed6b837cd66041a812328bad467369548ff18a166220d22446e0d23da7e61b","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:11:19.351Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:18:20.177Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An office full of characters, an